# Git and deployment

- Never force-push. Do not rewrite established history unless explicitly asked.
- Make logical commits. Do not push unless asked.
- Staging site is `https://rice-siam.github.io/`. `astro.config.mjs` `site` must match that until domain mapping.
- Do not add a `CNAME` or switch `site` to `https://siam.rice.edu` until approved.
- This is the organization-root Pages repository. Do not set an Astro `base` path.
- Deploy through GitHub Actions (`withastro/action` + `deploy-pages`).
- Before creating a commit, run `npm run lint`, `npm run format:check`, `npm run build`, and `npm run test:a11y`. All four must pass. If one fails, fix it and re-run that check. Do not commit on a failure.
- The same four checks must pass before push.
- The deploy workflow rebuilds nightly so dated events move from upcoming to past without client-side JavaScript.
